/07/dont-abuse-mathmax-mathmin.html","score":4,"flags":0,"comment_count":2,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"journeysquid","user_is_author":false,"tags":["go"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/ik4vqb","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/ik4vqb/don_t_abuse_math_max_math_min"},{"short_id":"q918vn","created_at":"2015-07-23T10:56:00.000-05:00","title":"Prompt Joins the Travis Foundation","url":"http://foundation.travis-ci.org/2015/07/23/prompt-joins-the-travis-foundation/","score":3,"flags":0,"comment_count":4,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"nalentados","user_is_author":false,"tags":["culture"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/q918vn","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/q918vn/prompt_joins_travis_foundation"},{"short_id":"sdjujl","created_at":"2015-07-23T09:39:53.000-05:00","title":"Comparing how security experts and non-experts stay safe online","url":"http://googleonlinesecurity.blogspot.com/2015/07/new-research-comparing-how-security.html","score":10,"flags":2,"comment_count":2,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"lynge","user_is_author":false,"tags":["security"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/sdjujl","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/sdjujl/comparing_how_security_experts_non"},{"short_id":"pazfrs","created_at":"2015-07-23T09:39:52.000-05:00","title":"Introducing mockturtle, the ##lobsters channel bot","url":"","score":7,"flags":0,"comment_count":1,"description":"\u003cp\u003eI'd like to introduce mockturtle, the ##lobsters channel bot.  He announces new submissions to lobster.rs while keeping us company in the channel.  The bot was created shortly after kristof announced a lobste.rs IRC channel on freenode, ##lobsters,[1][2] with story submission being a commonly requested feature.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe name mockturtle is a reference to the Mock Turtle in Alice's Adventures in Wonderland, who sings a song called the Lobster Quadrille.[3]  If you ask mockturtle to \u003ccode\u003e.sing\u003c/code\u003e he'll quote a random line from this song.  He will also search (\u003ccode\u003e.g\u003c/code\u003e or \u003ccode\u003e.w\u003c/code\u003e), look up words (\u003ccode\u003e.dict\u003c/code\u003e), and fetch title information for URLs pasted in the channel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the curious, mockturtle publishes new story submissions using irker,[4] after receiving them via the lobste.rs email gateway.[5]  Channel commands are handled by willie.[6]\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI've enjoyed interacting with the lobste.rs community on IRC, and I hope you find mockturtle as useful as I do.  If you would like to submit a bug or feature request, please message me or leave a comment here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1: \u003ca href=\"https://lobste.rs/s/tijdz1/an_official_irc_channel_for_lobsters\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eAn Official IRC Channel for Lobsters\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2: \u003ca href=\"https://lobste.rs/s/2hdoop/re_an_official_lobsters_channel\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eRe: An Official Lobsters Channel\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3: \u003ca href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Mock_Turtle%27s_Song\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eThe Mock Turtle's Song\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4: \u003ca href=\"http://www.catb.org/esr/irker/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eirker - An IRC notification Bot\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5: \u003ca href=\"https://lobste.rs/s/jg3eet\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eLobsters by mail\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e6: \u003ca href=\"http://willie.dftba.net/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003eWillie - The Python IRC Bot\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"I'd like to introduce mockturtle, the ##lobsters channel bot.  He announces new submissions to lobster.rs while keeping us company in the channel.  The bot was created shortly after kristof announced a lobste.rs IRC channel on freenode, ##lobsters,[1][2] with story submission being a commonly requested feature.\r\n\r\nThe name mockturtle is a reference to the Mock Turtle in Alice's Adventures in Wonderland, who sings a song called the Lobster Quadrille.[3]  If you ask mockturtle to `.sing` he'll quote a random line from this song.  He will also search (`.g` or `.w`), look up words (`.dict`), and fetch title information for URLs pasted in the channel.\r\n\r\nFor the curious, mockturtle publishes new story submissions using irker,[4] after receiving them via the lobste.rs email gateway.[5]  Channel commands are handled by willie.[6]\r\n\r\nI've enjoyed interacting with the lobste.rs community on IRC, and I hope you find mockturtle as useful as I do.  If you would like to submit a bug or feature request, please message me or leave a comment here.\r\n\r\n\r\n1: [An Official IRC Channel for Lobsters](https://lobste.rs/s/tijdz1/an_official_irc_channel_for_lobsters)\r\n\r\n2: [Re: An Official Lobsters Channel](https://lobste.rs/s/2hdoop/re_an_official_lobsters_channel)\r\n\r\n3: [The Mock Turtle's Song](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Mock_Turtle%27s_Song)\r\n\r\n4: [irker - An IRC notification Bot](http://www.catb.org/esr/irker/)\r\n\r\n5: [Lobsters by mail](https://lobste.rs/s/jg3eet)\r\n\r\n6: [Willie - The Python IRC Bot](http://willie.dftba.net/)","submitter_user":"alynpost","user_is_author":false,"tags":["meta"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/pazfrs","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/pazfrs/introducing_mockturtle_lobsters"},{"short_id":"me5yg0","created_at":"2015-07-23T09:31:17.000-05:00","title":"Optimising pointer subtraction with 2-adic integers.","url":"http://blog.sigfpe.com/2010/05/optimising-pointer-subtraction-with-2.html","score":12,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"hdevalence","user_is_author":false,"tags":["compilers","math"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/me5yg0","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/me5yg0/optimising_pointer_subtraction_with_2"},{"short_id":"pwfhzw","created_at":"2015-07-23T07:39:22.000-05:00","t